## Proposed Changes

---

### Frontend Components

#### [MODIFY] [SubmitExpenseTab.tsx](file:///d:/vibe%20code/spend-managment/project/frontend/src/features/expenses/SubmitExpenseTab.tsx)
- Define a CDN script loader function `loadTesseractScript` that appends the `Tesseract.js` script tag to the DOM and resolves when `window.Tesseract` is available.
- Implement `extractOcrFromText(text: string, filename: string): OcrExtracted`:
  - Split text into lines.
  - Implement heuristic parsing rules for Amount, Date, Vendor, and Tax ID.
  - Combine text-based results with filename-based parsing (`extractOcrFromFile`) as fallbacks for any fields that could not be confidently identified in the text.
- Modify `handleFileChange`:
  - Check if the uploaded file is an image (`file.type.startsWith('image/')`).
  - If it is an image, set loading status and show a scanning spinner.
  - Load `Tesseract.js` dynamically, initialize a worker (`Tesseract.createWorker('eng')`), perform OCR recognition on the file, and terminate the worker.
  - Pass the recognized text into `extractOcrFromText` to compute the values.
  - If any error occurs or the file is not an image, fall back immediately to `extractOcrFromFile`.
  - Populate the expense form fields and show a notification toast upon completion.

